# Paths the secret scanner skips, as fnmatch globs (one per line).
# Copied to .secretsignore in a scaffolded project. Comments start with #.
#
# Keep this list narrow: every entry is a place a real secret can hide.
# Prefer fixing the finding or adding an inline "# nosecret" on the line.
#
# tests/fixtures/*
# docs/examples/*
# *.min.js
